# Car Rental Website – Admin Dashboard & Landing Page CMS Prompt

## Project Goal

Create a complete Admin Dashboard for the existing Car Rental Website built with React + Vite + Tailwind + shadcn/ui.

The admin panel should allow the website owner to edit all landing page content dynamically without changing code.

---

# Main Requirements

## 1. Authentication

Create secure admin authentication.

Features:

- Admin login page
- Protected admin routes
- Logout functionality
- Session persistence
- Role-based access (optional)

Tech:

- Supabase Auth or JWT authentication

---

