# Final Expected Result

The final system should allow the admin to completely manage the entire car rental website from the dashboard without editing source code.

The website owner should be able to:

- Edit landing page content
- Upload images
- Manage bookings
- Update cars
- Change SEO settings
- Control branding
- Monitor analytics

Everything must be dynamic, responsive, scalable, and production-ready.
